{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_501_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_501_st_01_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "3ab9c5865c2ca1273d1de26964628416986535ccfbd8fc32cbcfa91a05a979b1", "ja": "でも、いっぱい練習しましたから！\nきっと大丈夫ですよね♪", "zh": "不过，我们已经进行了充分的练习！\n一定没问题的，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_501_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_501_st_01_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "cabff19c8c4183bb982e12204b9678f309c5f33244e5fdf5fd22dfe40a9583a0", "ja": "今日はみんなで気持ちをひとつにして、\nめいっぱいの感謝をお届けしましょう！", "zh": "今天大家齐心协力，把满满的感谢传达给大家吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_501_st_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_501_st_01_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "eb973a36cd9e46ee7830aeb9db81f8311e023f3748755cefc5033f2d26e08931", "ja": "それじゃ、{$P$}さん、そろそろ\n時間ですから、私たちも楽屋へ戻りましょうか。", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生，差不多到时间了，我们也回后台吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
